    <div class='about-slide__section'>
      <div class='about-slide__content'>
        <h3 class='about-slide__heading'>Managed AnyCable, Pro, or open source</h3>
        <p class='about-slide__text'>
          Start on Managed AnyCable with two free cables. Move to self-hosted Pro when you want it on your own infrastructure, or run open source for free. All three speak the same protocol, so moving between them takes no code changes.
        </p>
        <h3 class='about-slide__subtitle'>Your messages stay on your servers</h3>
        <p class='about-slide__text'>
          Self-hosted Pro and open source keep every realtime message, chat history included, inside your infrastructure. Nothing goes to a third party, which is why healthcare teams run AnyCable for HIPAA-covered data.
        </p>
